# Release DMG in git

When the user asks to push/upload to git («залий на гіт» / similar):

1. Build/package if needed so `dist/Stack-Meter-AI-<latest>.dmg` exists.
2. **Only the latest version** belongs in `dist/` and in the commit.
3. Delete any older `dist/Stack-Meter-AI-*.dmg` and `*.dmg.sha256` before staging.
4. Do not commit multiple DMG versions side by side.
5. Prefer `bash scripts/package.sh` — it already removes previous DMGs when creating a new one.
